{"color":"DEFAULT","isTrashed":false,"isPinned":false,"isArchived":false,"textContent":"CI: \nContinuous integration\nevery change is autmatically merged built and tested\n\nCDel\n\nContinuous delivery\n\nevery change that passes the CI is automatically packaged and kept ready\n\nCDep\n\nContinuous deployment \n\ngoes step further: every passing change is realesed to users\n\nthe ci/cd pipeline\n\npush code -> build -> test -> package -> deploy\n\ngh actions: ci/cd built into your repo \n\nevent: what triggers the run\n\nworkflow: a YAML file describing the whole automated process\n\njob: a set of steps that runs on a fresh virtual machine (\"runner\")\n\nstep/action: a single command or a reusable action from the marketplace\n\nwhere ci/cd fits in the sdlc\n\nplan -> code -> build -> test -> release -> deploy -> monitor\n                                          test automated with gh actions\n\n","title":"CI/CD with github action C3","userEditedTimestampUsec":1783103602958000,"createdTimestampUsec":1783102518595000,"textContentHtml":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">CI:&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Continuous integration<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;v